    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">GST e-Way Bills are electronic forms required for inter-state transportation of goods. These bills serve as proof of payment of goods' GST and facilitate smooth movement of goods across state borders.</p>
