	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>IBA (Indian Bureau of Railways) approved Lorry Receipts (LR/Bilty) serve as a legal document for transportation of goods.</span></li>
